{"schemaVersion":1,"id":208,"sections":[{"id":"357001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20542],"start":0,"count":55}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:1","scriptId":20542,"text":"一封带有特殊蜡印信被放在了维多利亚的面前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":554,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:2","scriptId":20542,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:3","scriptId":20542,"text":"看上去像是特勤局的演习邀请函，这类信件维多利亚见多了，大部分都会被她扔进废纸篓然后再委婉地回以一封拒绝信。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:4","scriptId":20542,"text":"不过今天的情况有点特殊，这封信的牵头人是蒂娅——死水的副团长。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:5","scriptId":20542,"text":"由于和自己的副官有关系，维多利亚不得不重新阅读起信件的内容。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":554,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:6","scriptId":20542,"text":"“以小队形式进行混战演习，最后的胜者将得到相应的奖励？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:7","scriptId":20542,"text":"这种司空见惯的演习模式没什么新意，基本就是夺旗战的混战版。主要是以训练新兵为目标，死水不过是可靠的陪练。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:8","scriptId":20542,"text":"如果是有报酬的陪练也就算了，对死水的队伍来说，少做一两份委托去参加无聊又无偿的演习，简直就是在浪费时间燃烧金钱。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":554,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:9","scriptId":20542,"text":"“说是有奖励，但也没写奖励的内容嘛……？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:10","scriptId":20542,"text":"确保自己没有看漏信的内容之后，维多利亚下意识的抖了抖信封。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":554,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:11","scriptId":20542,"text":"“哦？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:12","scriptId":20542,"text":"信封里掉出了一张很小巧的照片。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:13","scriptId":20542,"text":"“这……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:14","scriptId":20542,"text":"照片里是一组骸骨，但和一般的骸骨不同，这些骸骨的裂纹处有暴露出一些金属的部分。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:15","scriptId":20542,"text":"“这骨头……看上去好像不一般。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:16","scriptId":20542,"text":"维多利亚把照片翻了过来，后面写着一行小字——“请务必将骸骨赢下来～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:17","scriptId":20542,"text":"“蒂娅的字迹，看来这次的演习是必须要胜出才行了呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:18","scriptId":20542,"text":"“虽然不是很清楚蒂娅的目的，但既然是她的要求……那我这边还是要派出些强力的队伍来保证万无一失。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:19","scriptId":20542,"text":"维多利亚从抽屉里取出死水人员的名册，这本名册隔天会由接待员更新一次好让团长能掌握死水人员的流动情况。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:20","scriptId":20542,"text":"虽然心里已经大致想好了人员安排，但保险起见还是要确认一下。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:21","scriptId":20542,"text":"“嗯……扎莉、塞西莉亚……蕾贝卡也在，有这几个家伙在应该能轻松拿下特勤局的新丁们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:24","scriptId":20542,"text":"“事情就是这样，你们小队如果不忙的话，也去参加一下这个项目。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:25","scriptId":20542,"text":"维多利亚把事情的原委口述了一下，当然关于骸骨的事情并没有提及，只说报酬丰厚。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:26","scriptId":20542,"text":"“混战的话，如果遇到死水的伙伴也要攻击吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:27","scriptId":20542,"text":"虽然感觉有些多余，但是我仍旧问了一句。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":553,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:28","scriptId":20542,"text":"“是的，混战的规则就是如此，不过我们还是想尽量让特勤局的菜鸟们提升一下，所以请尽量选特勤局的队伍当对手。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:29","scriptId":20542,"text":"“了解。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:30","scriptId":20542,"text":"（哇……就是想说，让死水包揽前几名吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:31","scriptId":20542,"text":"把心中的话咽了回去，我转身走出了团长室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":553,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:34","scriptId":20542,"text":"等在门口的是佐伊和佩妮，本来打算早上和她们一起去小镇买些鲜花和水果，结果因为团长的突然召集不得不推迟到下午。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:35","scriptId":20542,"text":"“怎么样？是新任务吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:36","scriptId":20542,"text":"“怎么说呢，比较微妙的任务……佐伊，这次你跟我一起行动。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":744,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:37","scriptId":20542,"text":"“诶！？怎么那么突然？难道是什么单独行动的任务？一点心理准备都没有啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:38","scriptId":20542,"text":"“单独行动？呃……差不多吧，当我的保镖就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":744,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:39","scriptId":20542,"text":"“诶？贴身保镖？是要做潜入任务吗？还是说要假扮情侣什么的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:40","scriptId":20542,"text":"“姐姐闭嘴，先听长官说完。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:41","scriptId":20542,"text":"佩妮的话听上去很平静，但她那充满疑问的视线刺得我脊背发凉……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:42","scriptId":20542,"text":"“呃……事情是这样的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:43","scriptId":20542,"text":"一番解释后——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":744,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:44","scriptId":20542,"text":"“什么嘛……原来是让我观战啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:45","scriptId":20542,"text":"“就是这么回事，毕竟我们小队比一般队伍的人数要多。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:46","scriptId":20542,"text":"“而且从要求来看，姐姐确实不适合这次任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:47","scriptId":20542,"text":"“恩，就是这么回事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:48","scriptId":20542,"text":"附和着佩妮我连连点头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:49","scriptId":20542,"text":"“哦，是这样啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:50","scriptId":20542,"text":"“因为平时你和佩妮担任的工作基本重合，所以这次只要派你们之中的一个就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:51","scriptId":20542,"text":"“所以你就选了佩妮！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:52","scriptId":20542,"text":"被佐伊这么一问……当场语塞。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:53","scriptId":20542,"text":"“那个……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:54","scriptId":20542,"text":"“这次维多利亚团长是要求取胜为主，胜得越多报酬越多，如果让姐姐你上，难保不出意外。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:55","scriptId":20542,"text":"“恩，就是这么回事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:56","scriptId":20542,"text":"佩妮的解围非常及时，于是我又附和着佩妮连连点头……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:57","scriptId":20542,"text":"“唔……好吧，跟着长官行动好像也比较轻松～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:58","scriptId":20542,"text":"佐伊还是老样子，喜怒切换速度快得让人咋舌。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"357001-PROLOGUE:20542:59","scriptId":20542,"text":"就这样，我们小队也被纳入了混战演习的出场队伍。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
